  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your skills have allowed you to modify your ravels when they return to their normal state.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Ability to weave ravels.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> When you gain this feat, choose a single ravel. That ravel is treated as your reserve ravel. You do not gain any of the benefits of your reserve ravel, and it cannot be unweaved.</p>\n<p>Whenever one of your ravels stops being unwoven, you can choose to replace that ravel with one of your reserve ravels, gaining the effects of your reserve ravel and placing the original ravel in reserve.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> This feat can be selected multiple times, allowing you to choose an additional reserve ravel each time it is selected.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/raveler-class#toc57\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
